- Add "Logout" button/action in `ControlScroll` or a new section.
- Implement `signOut` logic using Supabase.
- Add `fullScreen` state to toggle [IdentityCard](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/IdentityCard.tsx#33-176) full-screen mode.

